# GraphActivity

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphActivity } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphActivity
  title="example"
  weekStartsOn={0}
/>
```

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `days` | `ActivityDay[]` | `—` | — |
| `weekStartsOn?` | `0 | 1` | `0` | — |
| `max?` | `number` | `—` | — |
| `legend?` | `boolean` | `true` | — |
| `caption?` | `string | false` | `—` | — |
| `glyphs?` | `Glyphs` | `—` | — |
| `palette?` | `GraphPalette` | `—` | — |
| `corner?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `ActivityDay`
- `GraphActivityProps`
